SUMMARY:Trivia Night at Tellus!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nWe are having a lot of fun doin
 g team Trivia nights at Tellus 360 in downtown Lancaster City\, so we are 
 keeping this going! Trivia events are every Tuesday at 7pm\, on the first 
 floor of Tellus\, join us when we go as a group!\n\nTellus 360 is located 
 at 24 E King St. in Lancaster City. Penn Square parking garage is very clo
 se\, and on-street parking in the city is free after 6pm! Tellus 360 is a 
 bar\, members must be 21+ and bring identification. Shout out to Nate G. f
 or the creation of these events!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 317553188/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261123T164205Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261123T164205Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
